layout_and_css_specifications.divider_70_percent_pipe:
Vertical divider pipe line height is set to 70% of the container height and vertically centered (`height: 70%`, `top: 15%`). CSS implementation detail:
html body #public-site #rakhigarhi-reference #the-ambition .prose-col-right::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 15%;
  height: 70%;
  width: 1px;
  background-color: #ddd6cf;
}
